      <p class="hero-desc">I make <strong>tech, product and lifestyle UGC</strong> that feels like a trusted recommendation — not an ad you skip. Confident enough to stop the scroll. Real enough to actually sell.<br><br><strong>Austrian creator. Works globally. German & English.</strong></p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
