  </div>
</div>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about-strip">
  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="as-mono">// about</div>
    <h2 class="as-h">Content made by<br>someone who actually<br><em>uses this stuff.</em></h2>
    <p class="as-body" style="margin-top:16px;">Based in Austria. Working globally. I create tech and product UGC that feels like a recommendation from someone you trust — which is exactly why it converts.<br><br>Bilingual delivery, fast turnaround, licensing tailored per project.</p>
